{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refence</strong>\u00a0-- a roguelite based idle defense game where you can choose heroes and their traits, upgrade your castle, and manage resources to fend off enemies trying to attack your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through timelines to defeat the invading enemies of the Demon Realm one by one and restore peace to the world</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire heroes to automatically defend against enemy threats, upgrade heroes and choose different traits based on the battlefield and enemies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/3f72ad56b76baed6fb08fa416fea55b0.poster.avif?t=1745456753\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/3f72ad56b76baed6fb08fa416fea55b0.webm?t=1745456753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/3f72ad56b76baed6fb08fa416fea55b0.mp4?t=1745456753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your castle, unlock upgrades, and summon more heroes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/0809ba07e8f895bcfaa906777c1340e3.poster.avif?t=1745456753\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/0809ba07e8f895bcfaa906777c1340e3.webm?t=1745456753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/0809ba07e8f895bcfaa906777c1340e3.mp4?t=1745456753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct research to unlock useful QoL and abilities that will aid you and your heroes in battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/2e0e9394cd5a569f179f384a580caa5b.avif?t=1745456753\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful relics to help you defend against enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras/eec64c1da1d6a08d70686879504a18b6.avif?t=1745456753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427090/extras_big/eec64c1da1d6a08d70686879504a18b6.avif?t=1745456753 width=800 height=426 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send heroes on quests to make progress while you are away!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gotcha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427090/61ad749bb8cf15b43082f9bebbea933cfbc6cd82.jpg"},{"name":"Difficulty 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427090/04a5064699145b00dff2ebefce96f0534e8222c2.jpg"},{"name":"Difficulty 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427090/a95785489b93bc0d5dae227af895ec3e62d4b5b6.jpg"},{"name":"Difficulty 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427090/551d48c13dc9d98314450408e951d607d326e827.jpg"},{"name":"Difficulty 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427090/bf800d8bc038d670608066ee5ae25cf1f0d4cdbb.jpg"},{"name":"Difficulty 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom